# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
#
# Serial script for ci/test-install (docs/decisions.md D113): on firmware holding only Microsoft's
# keys, the medium's shim refuses systemd-boot and starts MokManager. Enroll beamline.der from the
# ESP as a person would: view the key, enroll it, reboot. shim then starts systemd-boot. Items are
# chosen by name: the order of a FAT directory's entries is not the order of their names. Never
# part of an image.
expect Verification failed
sleep 1
send {enter}
expect Press any key to perform MOK management
send {enter}
choose Enroll key from disk
# The volumes, by label.
choose ESP
choose beamline\.der
choose View key 0
expect Fingerprint
sleep 2
send {enter}
choose Continue
choose Yes
choose Reboot
